---
/**
 * TwoProducts — unified homepage section introducing ZenML + Kitaru.
 *
 * Three-beat composition: eyebrow + three-sentence headline + two
 * product cards (white fill, gray-200 border, FeatureCard typography).
 *
 * Brand-rule compliance:
 *   - Section ground is a subtle bottom-up zenml-50 → white gradient.
 *     Brand colors otherwise live only as restrained accent marks
 *     (dots, CTA text). No cross-brand surface mixing.
 *
 * Voice tier: ZenML (with Kitaru permission-granting register inside
 * the Kitaru descriptor copy). Banned terms swept clean — Kitaru side
 * uses runtime / flow / checkpoint, not pipeline / orchestrator.
 */
---

<section class="scroll-reveal-section border-b border-gray-200 bg-linear-to-t from-zenml-50 to-white py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header: eyebrow + headline -->
    <div class="scroll-slide-top max-w-3xl">
      <div class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-gray-600">
        Two products · one team
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        ML systems today. Agent systems tomorrow. One engineering team underneath both.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Descriptor row: two product cards -->
    <div class="scroll-fade-in stagger-1 mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- ZenML card -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 transition-colors hover:border-gray-300">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zenml-500">
          ZenML — ML/AI Orchestration
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-gray-900">
          The open-source platform for production ML systems.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Orchestrate workflows across your existing tools, clouds, and environments. Modular, agnostic, no lock-in.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3">
          {[
            "Pipelines and stacks across any cloud",
            "Model registry, lineage, and reproducibility built in",
            "Open source — your stack, your data, your governance",
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-zenml-50">
                <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-zenml-600" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M2.5 6.25L4.75 8.5L9.5 3.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.67" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <a
          href="/features"
          class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-1 self-start text-sm font-semibold text-zenml-500 transition-colors group-hover:text-zenml-600"
        >
          <span>Explore ZenML</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 21 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M4.667 10h11.666m0 0L10.5 4.167M16.333 10 10.5 15.833" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.67" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Kitaru card -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 transition-colors hover:border-gray-300">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-700">
          Kitaru — Agent Runtime
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-gray-900">
          The runtime layer underneath your agent stack.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Every run recorded and replayable — diagnose failures, test model swaps, ship updates with confidence. Self-hosted, framework-agnostic, no lock-in.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3">
          {[
            "Crash recovery — flows survive pod evictions and timeouts",
            "Pause and resume with kitaru.wait() — minutes, hours, or days",
            "Your cloud, your model, your SDK — framework-agnostic",
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-orange-50">
                <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-orange-700" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M2.5 6.25L4.75 8.5L9.5 3.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.67" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700">{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <a
          href="/product/kitaru"
          class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-1 self-start text-sm font-semibold text-orange-700 transition-colors group-hover:text-orange-800"
        >
          <span>Explore Kitaru</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 21 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M4.667 10h11.666m0 0L10.5 4.167M16.333 10 10.5 15.833" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.67" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Slide-in-from-top for the header */
  .scroll-slide-top {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-30px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease-out, transform 0.6s ease-out;
  }

  /* Fade-in for descriptor row + product frame */
  .scroll-fade-in {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s ease-out;
  }

  /* Stagger delay — match FeatureTabs / ValueProps / NewsSection convention */
  .stagger-1 { transition-delay: 0.15s; }

  /* Revealed state */
  .scroll-reveal-section.in-view .scroll-slide-top,
  .scroll-reveal-section.in-view .scroll-fade-in {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  /* Respect reduced-motion preference */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scroll-slide-top,
    .scroll-fade-in {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.scroll-reveal-section').forEach((section) => {
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      ([entry]) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          section.classList.add('in-view');
          observer.disconnect();
        }
      },
      { threshold: 0.15 }
    );
    observer.observe(section);
  });
</script>